WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.310 --> 00:00:06.170
What happens to This Perfect Day by Ira Levin
when it is placed into SCP-914?

00:00:06.170 --> 00:00:11.260
One flash drive containing a text file of
This Perfect Day by Ira Levin was placed into

00:00:11.260 --> 00:00:13.639
the Clockworks on the setting "Very Fine."

00:00:13.639 --> 00:00:15.710
The output produced was:

00:00:15.710 --> 00:00:19.430
One flash drive containing a single .jar executable.

00:00:19.430 --> 00:00:24.279
Every attempt made to decompile the file was
met with failure and a notice of "technical

00:00:24.279 --> 00:00:25.439
difficulty."

00:00:25.439 --> 00:00:30.750
When executed, a log file was created depicting
"The Most Effective Way of Life" for everyone

00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:36.850
in a 200 meter radius, followed by ten genome
sequences with five for each gender.

00:00:36.850 --> 00:00:40.010
Intern Beauvillier voted, “Interesting,
to say the least.

00:00:40.010 --> 00:00:43.260
Although I don't see myself becoming a plumber
anytime soon.”

